  },
  {
   "index": 24,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "class": "kiosq-b",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main",
    "article",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 864,
   "text": "The XV273U F5 is fully ready for gaming on PC or console and has all the features to enhance gameplay at any skill level. You get plenty of aiming points and sniper modes, along with a set of timers. The overdrive and backlight strobe are enabled when your system can’t push the frame rates to 540 or 1,000, and they work extremely well, with significant blur reduction and no ghosting or phasing art",
   "counts": {
